    "image_with_text_PYx3yi": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "richtext_8djb6F": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Because while Studio Peake may have started with me, it certainly hasn’t grown because of me alone.</p><p>The truth is, the studio is here because of the incredible people we work with. Without each and every one of them, Studio Peake simply wouldn’t be what it is today. The past five years have been an exciting journey and a constant learning curve—one that never seems to flatten out—and it’s been made possible by the talent, expertise and support of those around us.</p><p>Over time, I’ve realised something very clearly: every project is only ever as good as the people you’re working with. We care deeply about quality and detail, and we hold ourselves to very high standards. We want to work with the best—and we are so lucky that we do.</p><p>We are endlessly grateful to the architects, landscape designers, lighting designers, project managers and contractors we collaborate with. Their professionalism, experience and creative thinking elevate every project and make the process not only smoother, but genuinely enjoyable.</p><p>We also owe so much to the suppliers and makers we rely on—people whose creativity, knowledge, craftsmanship and eye for detail constantly inspire us. Their work is what brings our ideas to life, and their expertise is something we lean on hugely throughout every stage of a project.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "richtext_8djb6F"
      ],
